  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a molcajete vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the grated carrots and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the molcajete vessel and stir to combine.",
    "Add the sherry, soy sauce, salt, and pepper to the rice mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Cook the rice mixture for 5 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Serve the Jubilant Norwegian Rice Fried Rice hot.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions, if desired."
